APK URL Hunter is a Go implementation of APK URL and pattern extraction.

The bundled rules/regexes.json is derived from APKLeaks by dwisiswant0:
https://github.com/dwisiswant0/apkleaks
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes: Basic_Auth_Credentials and Mailto use named captures instead of Python
lookbehind. JSON_Web_Token uses a Go-compatible expression with letter/digit
validation in Go. Scanning operates directly on APK entries, rather than JADX
decompiler output. No affiliation or endorsement by upstream is implied.
